<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 103,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 103,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 103,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000 and Saturday's actual receipts were 17,000, compared with the estimate of 10,000, USDA reported. Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50 per cwt lower than the midsession Friday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    54.50 -55.50	   55.50 -56.50</p>
<p>few one interest					   54.00</p>
<p>Sows:  uneven, generally steady to weak.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.00 -45.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -45.50	   44.00 -45.50</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   45.00 -48.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
